{"t":"COF","made":"2026-11-17 08:51","name":"Capital One Financial Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","employees":77500,"hq":"McLean, VA, United States","website":"https://www.capitalone.com","summary_en":"Capital One Financial Corporation operates as the financial services holding company for the Capital One, National Association, which engages in the provision of various financial products and services in the United States, Canada, and the United Kingdom. It operates through three segments: Credit Card, Consumer Banking, and Commercial Banking. The company accepts checking accounts, money market deposits, negotiable order of withdrawals, savings deposits, time deposits, and sweep accounts. Its loan products include credit card and personal loans; auto and retail banking loans; and commercial and multifamily real estate, and commercial and industrial loans. The company offers credit and debit card products; bank lending; and provides advisory, capital markets, net interchange, treasury management, and depository services. It serves consumers, small businesses, and commercial clients through digital channels, branches, cafés, and other distribution channels located in New York, Louisiana, Texas, Maryland, Virginia, New Jersey, and the District of Columbia. Capital One Financial Corporation was founded in 1988 and is headquartered in McLean, Virginia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Capital One Financial Corporation은 미국, 캐나다 및 영국에서 다양한 금융 상품 및 서비스를 제공하는 Capital One, National Association의 금융 서비스 지주 회사로 운영됩니다. 신용카드, 소비자금융, 상업금융의 3개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 회사는 당좌 예금, 머니 마켓 예금, 협상 가능한 인출 순서, 저축 예금, 정기 예금 및 스윕 계좌를 허용합니다. 대출상품에는 신용카드, 개인대출 등이 있습니다. 자동차 및 소매 금융 대출; 상업용 및 다세대 부동산, 상업용 및 산업용 대출. 회사는 신용카드 및 직불카드 상품을 제공합니다. 은행 대출; 자문, 자본 시장, 순 교환, 재무 관리 및 예탁 서비스를 제공합니다. 뉴욕, 루이지애나, 텍사스, 메릴랜드, 버지니아, 뉴저지 및 컬럼비아 특별구에 위치한 디지털 채널, 지점, 카페 및 기타 유통 채널을 통해 소비자, 중소기업 및 상업 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. Capital One Financial Corporation은 1988년에 설립되었으며 버지니아 주 맥클린에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":193.22,"mcap":116228243456.0,"pe":11.839461,"fpe":8.099101,"peg":0.1744,"ps":2.3771958,"pb":1.1044425,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":1.64,"beta":1.088,"hi52":259.64,"lo52":174.24},"fin":{"rev":48893001728.0,"rev_g":0.062,"eps_g":0.162,"gross":0.0,"op":0.31129,"net":0.22226,"roe":0.09392,"fcf":null,"cash":52224000000.0,"debt":55083999232.0,"de":null,"eps":16.32,"feps":23.85697},"own":{"short":0.0136,"inst":0.89575994,"insider":0.01599},"analyst":{"n":21,"mean":254.4762,"median":252.0,"high":290.0,"low":225.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.56522,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":14,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":14,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":5,"buy":14,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":15,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":274.0,"priorPriceTarget":280.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":285.0,"priorPriceTarget":280.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"BMO Capital","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":225.0,"priorPriceTarget":219.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":241.0,"priorPriceTarget":227.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":269.0,"priorPriceTarget":260.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":25